# Create user

[Index](../README.md) / [Section](../sections/users.md)

`POST {{base_url}}/users`

<p>Creates a user.</p>

## Headers

| Header | Value |
| --- | --- |
| `Content-Type` | `application/json` |
| `Authorization` | `Bearer {{token}}` |

## Body

Body type: `json`

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| `name` | `Ada` |
| `role` | `admin` |

## Expected behavior

- Expected: status 201

## Produces

- Produces: {{user\_id}} from json $.id

## Code samples

### curl

```sh
curl '{{base_url}}/users' -H 'Content-Type: application/json' -H 'Authorization: «redacted:token»' --data-raw '{"name":"Ada","role":"admin"}' -L
```

### httpie

```sh
http --ignore-stdin --follow '--raw={"name":"Ada","role":"admin"}' -- POST '{{base_url}}/users' \
  'Content-Type:application/json' \
  'Authorization:Bearer «redacted:token»'
```

### fetch

```js
const BASE_URL = "{{base_url}}";

const response = await fetch(BASE_URL + "/users", {
  method: "POST",
  headers: {
    "Content-Type": "application/json",
    "Authorization": "Bearer «redacted:token»",
  },
  body: JSON.stringify({"name": "Ada", "role": "admin"}),
});
console.log(response.status);
console.log(await response.text());
```

### python

```python
import requests

BASE_URL = "{{base_url}}"

response = requests.post(
    BASE_URL + "/users",
    json={"name": "Ada", "role": "admin"},
    headers={
        "Content-Type": "application/json",
        "Authorization": "Bearer «redacted:token»",
    },
)
print(response.status_code)
print(response.text)
```

### rust

```rust
// Cargo.toml: reqwest = { version = "0.12", features = ["blocking"] }

const BASE_URL: &str = "{{base_url}}";

fn main() -> Result<(), Box<dyn std::error::Error>> {
    let client = reqwest::blocking::Client::builder()
        .build()?;
    let response = client
        .request(reqwest::Method::POST, [BASE_URL, "/users"].concat())
        .header("Content-Type", "application/json")
        .header("Authorization", "Bearer «redacted:token»")
        .body("{\"name\":\"Ada\",\"role\":\"admin\"}")
        .send()?;
    println!("{}", response.status());
    println!("{}", response.text()?);
    Ok(())
}
```
